speechtext:
Just before calling orders of the day, perhaps I should bring to the attention of hon. members that the following matters will be discussed at the time of adjournment tonight: the hon. member for Battleford-Kindersley (Mr. Thomson)-Research-farm machinery;
December 14, 1971

the hon. member for Parkdale (Mr. Haidasz)-Airports; the hon. member for Comox-Alberni (Mr. Barnett)-Shipping-maintenance of service on west coast of Vancouver Island.
